It is a fork of Omarchy's built-in `omarchy.agents` bar widget, so that
Claude Code session status can share one bar button with the usage panel
instead of adding a second icon.

From Omarchy, unmodified:

    Main.qml
    Agent.qml
    assets/

From Omarchy, with three additions marked `[claude-status]`:

    Panel.qml

Original to this plugin:

    ClaudeStatus.qml
    ClaudeSessions.qml
    bin/omarchy-claude-status
    setup
    resync
    manifest.identity.json

`resync` re-derives the Omarchy-derived files from the copy of Omarchy
installed on the machine and re-applies the three additions, so the fork can
be brought back in line after an `omarchy update`.
